<header class="ref-head cen-head"><p class="cty-kicker">History by century · The 2000s</p><h1 class="research-title">The 21st century</h1><p class="ref-lede">In the 2000s, 268 recorded states existed somewhere in the world. 11 were founded and 8 came to an end. The great powers of the age included the United States, the People's Republic of China and the Federal Republic of Germany.</p></header>
